      "value": "There's updates of this Canny from VRChat Support.\nI've wait for updates on this critical issue but there was no updates for long time.\nTherefore I asked about this yesterday on VRChat Support.\nAfter that, status if this Canny is updated to Tracked Internally and there's message from VRChat Support.\nIn short, VRChat is already tracked this problem internally but they missed updating this Canny.\nI believe the message is true and this will be fixed soon.",
