      "value": "The latest update on the Steam platform will now correctly uninstall EAC. However, we aren't able to automate this process for the Oculus platform currently.\nTo manually uninstall EAC, you can follow the steps below:\n1. Navigate to your VRChat Installation Directory\n2. Open the EasyAntiCheat folder\n3. Type \"CMD\" in the File Explorer address bar and then hit Enter\n4. Paste \"EasyAntiCheat_EOS_Setup.exe uninstall a4a57ff548934dbeba0cc7c62cdf9f34\" into the Command Line without including quotation marks\nIf you've already uninstalled VRChat you can follow the steps here:\n1. Go to C:\\Program Files (x86) and delete \"EasyAntiCheat_EOS\"\n2. Run Command Prompt as admin and use the command \"sc delete EasyAntiCheat_EOS\"",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
